STATEMENT OF CHANGES  (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following files are original work added by this project:

  src/tasks/velocity/mdp/disturbance.py
      `deterministic_push` — an evaluation-time disturbance with exact magnitude,
      azimuth, trigger instant and duration, applied identically across a batch.

  src/tasks/velocity/mdp/recovery_metrics.py
      `RecoveryTracker` — per-environment latched recovery outcome, with fall,
      recovery time, velocity loss and push-delivery verification.

  src/tasks/velocity/config/g1/robust_env_cfg.py
      The three ablation arms (P1 nominal / P2 disturbances / P3 disturbances
      plus domain randomization).

  configs/protocol.yaml
      The pre-registered experimental protocol.

  scripts/eval_push.py, analyze_sweep.py, collect_metrics.py,
  scripts/make_split_video.py, make_figures.py, make_gifs.py,
  scripts/r0_audit.py, r1_verify_variants.py, dr_cost_probe.py,
  scripts/ckpt_dims.py, install_launchers.py, run_sweep.sh
      Evaluation, analysis, verification and figure/video tooling.

  docs/, README.md, results/
      Documentation, measurements, figures and videos.

The following upstream files were modified:

  src/tasks/velocity/config/g1/__init__.py
      Registers the three robustness tasks alongside the upstream tasks.

  setup.py
      Dependency upper bounds added. Upstream declares lower bounds only, and
      three transitive dependencies had moved past compatibility:
      mujoco >= 3.11 removed `mjENBL_MULTICCD` (breaks `import mujoco_warp`),
      warp-lang >= 1.13 relocated `wp.context`, and scipy was undeclared despite
      being required by the terrain generator.

The following upstream content was REMOVED from this distribution to reduce
repository size. It is unmodified and remains available upstream:

  src/assets/robots/{unitree_a2,unitree_as2,unitree_go2,unitree_h1_2,
                     unitree_h2,unitree_r1}/xmls/
  src/assets/motions/
      Mesh and motion assets for robots not used by this study. The
      corresponding `*_constants.py` modules are retained, because
      `src/assets/robots/__init__.py` imports them.

All other files are unmodified from unitree_rl_mjlab.
